        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, production from hydro power, at plant
Electricity domestic net production shares are based on annual averages for the year 2011.;
UUID: d23a83b9-848e-3994-8d22-2cf9f725aa47
Included are the shares of run-of-river, reservoir and small hydropower plants in the total hydropower electricity production at the busbar. Not included are transformation, transport or distribution losses.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Hydropower
Time period: Time period of statistics used.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Statistical data 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_d23a83b9-848e-3994-8d22-2cf9f725aa47.xml</text>
